flowchart TB
    Video["원본 영상"]:::input
    ShotGrid["ShotGrid 샷 정보"]:::input
    Review["프레임 탐색·비교·주석"]:::process
    Normalize["평가 요소 입력·정규화"]:::process
    Score["공통 코어로 점수·등급 계산"]:::process
    History[("평가 이력 누적 저장")]:::store
    Latest["샷·평가자별<br/>최신 유효 값 집계"]:::process
    Gate{"완료·권한·필드 충족?"}:::decision
    Block["반영 차단<br/>미완료·설정 안내"]:::error
    DryRun["드라이런·대상 목록 확인"]:::process
    Approve{"사용자 승인?"}:::decision
    Cancel["반영 취소"]:::output
    Write["최종 필드 반영 요청"]:::process
    Batch{"일괄 갱신 성공?"}:::decision
    Retry["개별 재시도<br/>실패 항목 표시"]:::process
    Done["처리 결과 확인"]:::output
    Video --> Review
    ShotGrid --> Review
    Review --> Normalize
    Normalize --> Score
    Score --> History
    History --> Latest
    Latest --> Gate
    DryRun --> Approve
    Write --> Batch
    Gate --> |"미충족"| Block
    Gate --> |"충족"| DryRun
    Block -.-> |"조건 확인 후 재조회"| Latest
    Approve --> |"취소"| Cancel
    Approve --> |"승인"| Write
    Batch --> |"실패"| Retry
    Batch --> |"성공"| Done
    classDef start fill:#176c62,stroke:#176c62,color:#ffffff
    classDef input fill:#e8f2fb,stroke:#83a7c4,color:#24475d
    classDef process fill:#f6f7f8,stroke:#afb9c1,color:#33424e
    classDef ai fill:#f0ebf9,stroke:#a897be,color:#4f3c68
    classDef decision fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#c5a363,color:#65502e
    classDef store fill:#edf4ec,stroke:#92af8b,color:#385733
    classDef output fill:#e6f3ec,stroke:#80aa94,color:#28543f
    classDef error fill:#fbede8,stroke:#c29482,color:#744a3d
